      "Meichenbaum, D. (1985); Díaz, Ruiz, & Villalobos (2012); Beck, A. T. et al. (1979).",
      "Meichenbaum (1985); Díaz, Ruiz y Villalobos (2012).",
      "Meichenbaum (1985).",
      "Meichenbaum (1985); Beck, Rush, Shaw y Emery (1979).",
